# The browser libraries the viewer inlines: Cytoscape, dagre and Graphviz built
# for WebAssembly. They are minified, so they are a handful of enormous lines -
# 1.8MB in about fifty of them - which is nothing to read and everything to
# scroll past in a review.
#
# linguist-vendored keeps them out of the repository's language statistics;
# -diff stops git printing a megabyte-long line when one of them is updated.
graph/html/assets/vendor/*.js linguist-vendored=true -diff

# NOTICE.md is deliberately not marked: it is the licence roll for the bundles
# above, hand-maintained and checked by a test, and a change to it is exactly
# the kind a reviewer has to see.
